2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $h=5$ and $k=1.$\n\nTherefore, the center of the hyperbola is $(5,1).$" 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087667 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348093 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087668 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348109 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087668 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348110 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087669 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348116 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087700 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348069 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087700 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348070 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087706 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348166 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087706 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348167 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087706 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348168 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087707 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348182 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087708 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348188 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087729 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348075 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087729 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348076 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087729 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348254 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087740 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348460 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087741 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348449 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087741 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348452 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087741 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348457 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087741 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348459 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087747 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348270 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087747 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348278 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087747 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348283 13194139533429 17592186045585 true] [17592186087749 1038 #edb/ref 17592186348169 13194139533429 17592